# Density Compare
# Caesium (Cs) — real density 1.879 g/cm³. equal masses: Caesium vs water — sides ∝ (1/ρ)^(1/3).
scene "Caesium Density Compare"

element_cube = cube 16.2mm color: #57178f at (-20mm, 8.1mm, 0)
water_cube = cube 20mm material: water at (18mm, 10mm, 0)
# both cubes weigh the same: about 15.0 g — the water cube is the reference
